          "text": "Nuko rero, Farawo amaze kurekura abo bantu, Imana ntiyabacisha mu nzira ica mu gihugu c’Abafilisitiya, nah’ ari yo yar’ irashe; kukw Imana yivuganije, it’ Abantu boye kuzohava bīcuza babonye intambara, bagasubira muri Egiputa. ",
