          "text": "Arikw ibajana izinguzingu, ibacishije mu nzira ica mu bugaragwa, ahabangikanye n’Ikiyaga Gitukura; nukw Abisirayeli bādūze bītwaje ibirwanishwa bavuye mu gihugu ca Egiputa. ",
