        {
          "text": "Kandi Mose ajanisha amagufa ya Yosefu, kuko Yosefu yari yararahije bene Isirayeli bikomeye, at’ Imana ntizobura kubagendera, namwe muze mukūre amagufa yanje ino, muyadūgane.",
